In the bedroom, I open my closet.
I look at my clothes.
I choose a blue shirt and black trousers.
Then I get dressed.
I comb my hair in front of the mirror.
Now I go out into the kitchen.
I am hungry.
I find a plate and a cup.
I make a quick breakfast.
Today I eat bread with cheese.
I pour coffee into the cup.
The coffee is black and strong.
I sit down at the table.
Here I eat my food.
It tastes good.
I drink my coffee.
Finally, I take my bag and my jacket.
I lock the door and go out.
